If multiple parameters are specified, the priority order is: UserImage > UserText > Position > Mask > ObjectRemoveElements = NonObjectRemoveElements.
For more information about each type, see the product documentation.
Image subject: the core product area in the image.', example='[1,2]', shrink='json', position='Query'),
  position?: string(name='Position', description='The specific removal area. This parameter must be used in conjunction with the editor. The input format is four-point coordinates [xx,yy,zz,dd]. This parameter is optional, but you must specify at least one of the following parameters: ObjectRemoveElements, NonObjectRemoveElements, Mask, Position, UserText, and UserImage.
