  bizName?: string(name='BizName', description='The name of the caller\\\\"s business, which represents your identity and facilitates subsequent communication. If you are an internal Alibaba team, specify this parameter based on the actual scenario, such as BU name-product or BU name-chat. If you are an external partner, specify the full name of your company. The company name must be the same as the one used when you registered your Alibaba Cloud account.', example='BUxxx-chat', position='Query'),
